Problem: ASC041 `link-route`, a warning
Message: this looks like the published route of `guide.md`; link to the file instead: `/guide.md`
How to fix it: Link to the page's file, not its URL: Ascribe writes each output's URLs. The editor's quick fix makes the change.
Ascribe has a safe automatic fix: `Link to the page's file instead of its route`.
Reference: https://ascribed-dev.com/go/ASC041/
